he type of application using Jinja. This vulnerability impacts users of applications which execute untrusted templates. Jinja's sandbox does catch calls to str.format and ensures they don't escape the sandbox. However, it's possible to use the |attr filter to get a reference to a string's plain format method, bypassing the sandbox. After the fix, the |attr filter no longer bypasses the environment's attribute lookup. This vulnerability is fixed in 3.1.6.","cvss":[{"source":"nvd@nist.gov","type":"Primary","version":"3.1","vector":"CVSS:3.1/AV:L/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:C/C:H/I:H/A:H","metrics":{"baseScore":8.8,"exploitabilityScore":2.1,"impactScore":6.1},"vendorMetadata":{}},{"source":"security-advisories@github.com","type":"Secondary","version":"4.0","vector":"CVSS:4.0/AV:L/AC:L/AT:P/PR:L/UI:P/VC:H/VI:H/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N/E:X/CR:X/IR:X/AR:X/MAV:X/MAC:X/MAT:X/MPR:X/MUI:X/MVC:X/MVI:X/MVA:X/MSC:X/MSI:X/MSA:X/S:X/AU:X/R:X/V:X/RE:X/U:X","metrics":{"baseScore":5.4},"vendorMetadata":{}}],"epss":[{"cve":"CVE-2025-27516","epss":0.00214,"percentile":0.43896,"date":"2026-03-29"}],"cwes":[{"cve":"CVE-2025-27516","cwe":"CWE-1336","source":"security-advisories@github.com","type":"Secondary"}]}],"matchDetails":[{"type":"exact-direct-match","matcher":"python-matcher","searchedBy":{"language":"python","namespace":"github:language:python","package":{"name":"jinja2","version":"3.1.5"}},"found":{"vulnerabilityID":"GHSA-cpwx-vrp4-4pq7","versionConstraint":"<=3.1.5 (python)"},"fix":{"suggestedVersion":"3.1.6"}}],"artifact":{"id":"pkg:pypi/jinja2@3.1.5?package-id=05266a37c40f43f6","name":"jinja2","version":"3.1.5","type":"python","locations":[{"path":"/.build/ci/requirements.txt","accessPath":""}],"language":"python","licenses":[],"cpes":["cpe:2.3:a:python-jinja2:python-jinja2:3.1.5:*:*:*:*:*:*:*","cpe:2.3:a:python-jinja2:python_jinja2:3.1.5:*:*:*:*:*:*:*","cpe:2.3:a:python_jinja2:python-jinja2:3.1.5:*:*:*:*:*:*:*","cpe:2.3:a:python_jinja2:python_jinja2:3.1.5:*:*:*:*:*:*:*","cpe:2.3:a:jinja2:pyt